&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Customer Success Intern – Mirakl Ads&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Mirakl Ads Customer Success team led by Arnaud Cappelaere, Business Consulting Manager. The team consists of 4 Customer Success professionals dedicated to helping eCommerce and Marketplace operators launch and grow their Retail Media programs. Together, you&#39;ll be enabling clients to unlock the full potential of their advertising business through expert guidance, performance analysis, and strategic support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Support the preparation and delivery of client workshops, onboarding sessions, training materials, and business reviews to drive client engagement and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Monitor key performance indicators and produce regular reports to track advertising network performance and surface actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Analyze Retail Media program data to identify performance trends and growth opportunities, translating findings into clear recommendations for client teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Conduct market research on Retail Media, eCommerce, digital advertising, and competitive dynamics to inform strategic decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Document best practices, processes, and client insights — and explore AI tools to improve reporting, insight generation, and the overall client experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Currently pursuing a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Business, Engineering, Marketing, Data, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Demonstrated interest in eCommerce, marketplaces, Retail Media, or digital advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Previous experience with data analysis or client-facing projects (academic or professional) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to turn data into clear conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Proactive and curious mindset with a hands-on approach to learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Ability to work effectively across multiple stakeholders in a fast-paced, international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Comfort working with AI tools to enhance productivity and output quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Tools Used&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Excel, Salesforce, Looker, Tableau, AI tools&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English &amp;amp; french(written and spoken) required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internship compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Between 1,200€ and 1,400€ per month (depending on profile)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A tailor-made integration path&lt;/strong&gt; to quickly gain skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowering and evolving missions&lt;/strong&gt; to get the most out of this experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A unique opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; to discover a French unicorn in full expansion and work with international teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A workplace that promotes well-being and balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Breakfasts, sports and yoga classes, aperitifs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-py-2 @md:s-leading-7 s-text-base s-leading-7 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-py-2 @md:s-leading-7 s-text-base s-leading-7 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application—this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-decimal s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Manuel screening of your CV &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;by a recruiter and then an &lt;strong&gt;AI-powered screening conversation&lt;/strong&gt; (10 min) with Emma, Mirakl’s AI Talent Ambassador to explore your background and motivation for the role. You will need to complete this step within 3 days, otherwise we won&#39;t be able to move forward with your application.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-decimal s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://vimeo.com/1073963262/5d76e579ef?fl=pl&amp;amp;fe=sh&quot;&gt;How to succeed in your interviews at Mirakl?&lt;span class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt; Watch the Video!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Intro Call&lt;/strong&gt;: Get to know each other with the recruiter, discuss your experience and answer your questions about Mirakl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Business Interview&lt;/strong&gt;: Meet your future manager and a team member to discuss your experience and motivation using structured interviews (STAR method)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Welcome to Mirakl!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, Mirakl processes your personal data to review and manage your application and, where appropriate, to consider your profile for future opportunities. You can exercise your data protection rights at any time, and as further detailed in our policies. For more information about how we process your personal data and your rights, please consult our Recruitment Privacy Notice, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in English and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/fr-FR/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in French.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mirakl:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Mirakl has been at the forefront of marketplace innovation, empowering every business to compete in the platform economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Mirakl’s operating system combines an enterprise marketplace solution (Mirakl Platform) that enables retailers and B2B organizations to launch, scale, and operate marketplaces and dropship, AI-powered multichannel selling (Mirakl Connect), retail media (Mirakl Ads) and an agentic commerce infrastructure (Mirakl Nexus).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With dual headquarters in Boston and Paris, Mirakl helps a global ecosystem of 450+ marketplaces (B2C and B2B) and a network of over 100k third-party marketplace sellers. Brands like Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos, and Airbus Helicopters use Mirakl to grow their businesses in new and remarkable ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mirakl.com&quot;&gt;www.mirakl.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl in Numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Founded in 2012 | Member of French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 750+ employees in 9 offices worldwide: Paris, Barcelona, Bordeaux, Boston, London, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Mirakl means accelerating your career alongside ambitious, passionate, and supportive colleagues. We&#39;re proud of the diversity of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences that make our teams unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 5 values guide how we collaborate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡&lt;strong&gt; Work Hard Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and collaboration are the foundation of our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Get Things Done: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We prioritize action and efficiency for impactful results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Go Above &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; We tackle challenges proactively and always aim for excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;Succeed Through Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge sharing and continuous learning are core to our culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Satisfy &amp;amp; Empower Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re committed to our clients&#39; success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;min-w-0 break-words text-base text-foreground&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex flex-col gap-y-4&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;font-conversation&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;w-full&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;*** We are open to candidates looking for either a six-month, full-time internship starting in January 2027, or a minimum 12-month apprenticeship starting in January 2027. ***&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center gap-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center gap-1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our EMEA Brand Design team led by Gavin Jones, Brand Design Manager. The team consists of 3 people, including this internship role, working closely with the wider Marketing organisation across the region. Together, you&#39;ll be bringing Mirakl&#39;s visual identity to life — crafting compelling, on-brand assets that support campaigns, drive awareness, and strengthen how we show up across digital and print channels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;This is a hands-on team where you&#39;ll be involved from day one. I&#39;ll be acting as a close mentor throughout your time here, and you&#39;ll have real ownership of projects. We check in weekly as a team to review progress, tackle challenges, and share best practices. You&#39;ll also collaborate closely with the wider Marketing team and manage incoming projects through Wrike, our project management tool.&quot;&lt;/em&gt; — Gavin Jones, Brand Design Manager&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-my-4 s-border-b s-border-primary-150 dark:s-border-primary-150-night&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Design visually engaging assets for digital platforms including social media, websites, and email campaigns, ensuring consistency with Mirakl&#39;s brand identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Create and layout print materials such as brochures, posters, flyers, and business cards that reflect our brand standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Contribute creative ideas in brainstorming sessions and support the evolution of Mirakl&#39;s visual identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Edit and optimise images for web use, balancing visual impact with performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Support multimedia projects including video editing or animation, as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-my-4 s-border-b s-border-primary-150 dark:s-border-primary-150-night&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;3. What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Currently studying or recently graduated in Graphic Design, Visual Communication, or a related creative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A strong portfolio showcasing a range of creative work across both digital and print formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Previous experience in a tech company or start-up environment is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Experience with Figma or equivalent UI/UX design tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of typography, colour theory, and layout design principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Ability to produce assets for both digital and print channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Familiarity with project management tools such as Wrike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-my-4 s-border-b s-border-primary-150 dark:s-border-primary-150-night&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;4. Tools Used&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;After Effects and/or Premiere Pro (a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Wrike&lt;/li&gt;
