&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Freenow is an equal opportunity employer and we consider qualified applicants regardless of race, religion, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability or age. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We want you to grow and evolve, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;bring your true self to work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FREENOW:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Freenow by Lyft empowers smarter mobility decisions, helping people to move freely and cities to thrive. Through our multi-mobility app, we feature broad options for everyone across 9 European markets and over 180 cities. Millions of passengers can access services including taxis, private hire vehicles, carsharing, car rental, e-scooters, e-bikes, e-mopeds, and public transport within a single app.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In July 2025 Freenow was acquired by Lyft, a global mobility platform, which connects riders and drivers for billions of rides across North America and Europe. Together, Freenow and Lyft are creating a more caring and connected world, with transportation for everyone. We are a global, diverse, highly motivated, and collaborative team that strives for excellence and likes to have fun. Ready for your next ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.de/%C3%9Cberblick/Arbeit-bei-FREE-NOW-EI_IE954578.11,19.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/bltadef6ed7354e9cc4/65a10957984e23040a418da6/glassdoor-logotype-rgb_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kununu.com/de/mytaxi-intelligent-apps&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/blte53af231aaa0c840/65a109382311a30407ba07ce/kununu_logo_black_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/free-now/life/2b1603ea-741a-49f8-9847-f1214f483a1a/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://brand.linkedin.com/content/dam/me/business/en-us/amp/brand-site/v2/bg/LI-Logo.svg.original.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;143&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Doctolib is looking for you to join our Patient Marketing team in&lt;strong&gt; Berlin&lt;/strong&gt; as a &lt;strong&gt;Working Student in B2C SEO and AI Search (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Patient Marketing helps Doctolib reach patients in Germany with relevant, useful content and strengthen access to healthcare. In this role, you will support content discoverability, content quality, conversion, data analysis, and AI-supported search initiatives.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a working student in B2C SEO and AI Search, you will support us in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content SEO, CMS and editing: support content strategies, maintain WordPress content, and optimize copy for patients and search&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keyword research, competitor analysis, and reporting: analyze the German health market and monitor SEO performance using tools such as Google Search Console and Semrush&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI search and cross-functional support: explore generative-AI-supported SEO work and collaborate with B2C Marketing and Patient Content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working with us, you will learn:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How SEO and AI search are applied in a fast-growing health-tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience in content optimization, CMS workflows, and SEO analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to collaborate across local and international marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You could be our next team mate if you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are studying marketing, media, communications, journalism, business administration, or a similar field, can work up to 20 hours per week during the semester, and have excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak&lt;strong&gt; German C2 and English C1 level&lt;/strong&gt;; French or Italian is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with a CMS such as WordPress and with AI tools such as Claude, Gemini, or ChatGPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Now, it would be fantastic if you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have first experience in SEO or content marketing and with tools such as Google Search Console or Keyword Planner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have initial experience with Canva or an interest in translation and generative AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have previous experience in marketing, communications, journalism, editorial work, publishing, or healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured and personalized onboarding program through our &lt;strong&gt;Doctolib Academy&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as a wide range of in-house training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;flexible working model&lt;/strong&gt; that allows for hybrid and office-based work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;Deutschlandticket &lt;/strong&gt;sponsored by Doctolib, or &lt;strong&gt;reimbursement of your semester ticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;28 vacation days&lt;/strong&gt; per year (calculated pro rata according to your working schedule)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity to work from EU countries or the UK for up to 10 days per year (eligible after 6 months)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company health insurance&lt;/strong&gt; with many additional benefits and subsidies (eligible after 6 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular breakfast in the office and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;subsidies for your lunch or grocery shopping&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;subsidized sports program&lt;/strong&gt; with our partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First Interview with the Hiring Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study Interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working Student in part-time: up to 20 hours per week&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duration: 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace: Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: €15 gross/hour - (€16 gross/hour from January 2027)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date:&amp;nbsp; November 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid setup with 2 office days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g. pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Redwood, we empower our customers with lights-out automation for their mission-critical business processes.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redwood Software is the leading orchestration platform for the autonomous enterprise, driving business transformation at the lowest total cost of ownership. Redwood empowers organizations to intelligently automate and orchestrate mission-critical business and IT processes across complex ERP, hybrid cloud, data and emerging agentic AI systems. Through its SaaS-first automation fabric—with AI embedded across the automation lifecycle—Redwood accelerates the path to autonomous operations. Backed by 30 years of experience and trusted by more than 50% of the Fortune 50, Redwood helps organizations unlock human potential to focus on innovation, growth and what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;CORE VALUES&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One Team. One Redwood&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Make Your Own Weather&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Obsess over Customer Success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work the Problem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be Curious&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the Outcome&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Respect Each Other&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a leading SaaS company dedicated to delivering innovative solutions that empower businesses to streamline operations and drive growth. As we continue to expand our footprint in the enterprise sector, we are seeking a dynamic and results-driven Enterprise Account Executive to join our sales team.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise Account Executive will be responsible for identifying, developing, and closing new business opportunities with large enterprise clients. This role requires a consultative sales approach, deep understanding of enterprise needs, and the ability to navigate complex sales cycles to deliver tailored SaaS solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and prospect potential enterprise clients, targeting key decision-makers in relevant industries. Develop strategies to generate new business opportunities and build a robust sales pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize a consultative approach to understand client needs and pain points. Provide tailored solutions that demonstrate the value of our SaaS platform, aligning with the customer’s business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Cycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the entire sales process from lead generation to closing, including qualification, solution presentation, negotiation, and contract signing. Collaborate with internal teams to support client needs throughout the sales cycle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain strong, long-term relationships with key stakeholders at enterprise accounts, ensuring high levels of satisfaction and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with internal teams to develop and execute account strategies that lead to long-term partnerships and continued revenue growth. Identify upsell and cross-sell opportunities within existing accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Target Achievement:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistently meet or exceed monthly, quarterly, and annual sales quotas, focusing on closing large, high-value deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain an accurate and up-to-date pipeline of opportunities in the CRM. Provide regular sales forecasts and reports to senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay informed about industry trends, competitive landscape, and market dynamics. Share insights with the product and marketing teams to help shape the company’s go-to-market strategy and product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously refine sales processes, strategies, and tools to optimize efficiency and success in enterprise sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;YOUR EXPERIENCE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Marketing, Communications, or a related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in B2B SaaS sales, with at least 3 years of experience in enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of meeting or exceeding sales targets and closing large enterprise deals, ideally in complex, multi-stakeholder environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of SaaS sales processes, including value-based selling and account-based strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and negotiation skills, with the ability to influence C-level executives and other decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing long and complex sales cycles, with a focus on building strong client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with CRM software (e.g., Salesforce) and sales engagement tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a fast-paced, results-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, problem-solving abilities, and strategic thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;css-1i27f3a&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-ey7qxc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-1s1axh3&quot; data-automation-id=&quot;jobPostingDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you like growth and working with happy, enthusiastic over-achievers, you&#39;ll enjoy your career with us!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE LEGAL BIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Redwood is an equal opportunity employer. Redwood prohibits unlawful discrimination based on race, colour, religion, sex, gender identity, marital or veteran status, age, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information or characteristics (or those of a family member), sexual orientation, pregnancy or any other consideration made unlawful by regional or local laws. We also prohibit discrimination based on a perception that anyone has any of those characteristics or is associated with a person who has or is perceived as having any of those characteristics. All such discrimination is unlawful and will have a zero tolerance policy applied to it.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Redwood will comply with all local data protection laws, including GDPR when it comes to the handling and processing of personal data. Should you wish for us to remove your personal data from our recruitment database, please email us directly at -----
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Commodities &amp;amp; Energy Trading practice is growing and we are hiring Consultants and Senior Consultants (m/w/d) to join our team in Düsseldorf or Munich. The level offered will reflect your experience, expertise and demonstrated impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with leading commodity and energy trading organisations, utilities, and large energy consumers, supporting them to navigate increasingly complex markets, manage flexibility in their portfolio and deliver large-scale transformation programmes. Our work spans strategy, operating model and process design, trading transformation, and technology delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is your opportunity to combine deep industry exposure with hands-on client delivery, working directly with leading traders, utilities and renewable energy businesses as they transform their trading operations, integrate flexibility assets and adopt new technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with clients on a range of transformation and advisory engagements, including&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trading systems transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Supporting trading landscape design, system selection, implementation, and optimisation for core trading platforms and applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital &amp;amp; trading transformation&lt;/strong&gt;: Helping clients embed data strategies, analytics, and AI into trading operations and decision-making processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility services &amp;amp; integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Supporting the development and integration of flexibility capabilities across assets, technology platforms and commercial operations to maximise value in energy markets.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating model &amp;amp; business transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Supporting the design and implementation of trading operating models and end-to-end processes across the full commodity and energy trading lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk and regulatory advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Strengthening risk and regulatory frameworks, governance, and reporting across trading organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome professionals with experience in one or more of the following areas across LNG, Gas &amp;amp; Clean Fuels, Power, Metals, or Oil. &lt;br&gt;We recognise that great candidates come from a variety of backgrounds, so you do not need experience across all of these areas to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commodity and energy trading, risk management, market analysis, commercial operations or trading support functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trading transformation initiatives, helping organisations improve processes, systems and ways of working across the front-to-back trading lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data, analytics and emerging AI-enabled use cases within trading environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ETRM/CTRM platforms and supporting technologies, including business analysis, requirements gathering, testing, implementation or continuous improvement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market, credit, operational or regulatory risk topics, with an interest in helping trading organisations strengthen governance, controls and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your experience and interests, you may also bring skills in one or more of the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business analysis, problem solving and transformation delivery experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, including data analysis and visualisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with business and technology stakeholders to deliver practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in data, analytics, AI and digital technologies within commodity and energy trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Consultants are expected to demonstrate ownership of workstreams, adapt quickly to complex situations, and thrive in client-facing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in German and English is required for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Baringa is a People First company and wellbeing is at the forefront of our culture. We recognise the importance of work-life balance and flexible working and provide our staff amazing benefits. Some of these benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Generous Annual Leave Policy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We recognise everyone needs a well-deserved break. We provide our employees with 5 weeks of annual leave, fully available at the start of each year. In addition to this, we have introduced our 5-Year Recharge benefit which allows all employees an additional 2 weeks of paid leave after 5 years continuous service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We know that the ‘ideal’ work-life balance will vary from person to person and change at different stages of our working lives. To accommodate this, we have implemented a hybrid working policy and introduced more flexibility around taking unpaid leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Corporate Responsibility Days:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Our world is important to us, so all our employees get 3 every year to help social and environmental causes and increase our impact on the communities that mean the most to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Wellbeing Fund:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We want to encourage all employees to take charge and prioritise their own wellbeing. We’ve introduced our annual People Fund to support this by offering every individual a fund to support and manage their wellbeing through an activity of their choice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Profit Share Scheme:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; All employees participate in the Baringa Group Profit Share Scheme so everyone has a stake in the company’s success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We believe that creating an environment where everyone feels a sense of belonging is central to our culture and that diversity is paramount to driving creativity, innovation, and value for our clients and for our people.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;An award-winning workplace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You can be a part of our ‘Great Place to Work’ – with our commitment to women and well-being in the workplace for all. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/en/impact/awards/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; to see some of our recent awards and how we’ve achieved this.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Using business as a force for good.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We maintain high standards of environmental performance and transparency, which can be seen through our commitment to Net Zero with our SBTI-verified Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions reduction targets and our support of the Better Business Act. We report our progress publicly and ensure that we are also externally assessed and scored through organisations like CDP and EcoVadis - helping us to continually identify where we can improve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have a long legacy of supporting the communities in which we work, and offer a variety of ways to contribute, by putting people first and creating impact that lasts. Our Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) agenda is about giving back to the communities in which we live and work by sharing our skills, talent and time. In essence, we aim to empower and encourage everyone in the firm to contribute to the things we care about, and support registered charities and organisations with a clear social or environmental purpose to increase the positive impact they can have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Join us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All applications received will be reviewed by a member of our Talent Acquisition team. We never rely solely on automated screening or AI tools to make hiring decisions. Your application will be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, nationality, disability, age, faith or social background. We do not filter applications by university background and encourage those who have taken alternative educational and career paths to apply. We would like to actively encourage applications from those who identify with less represented and minority groups. We operate an inclusive recruitment process, ensuring reasonable adjustments where needed. Please contact a member of our Recruitment Team to discuss further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Baringa Privacy Notices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For UK &amp;amp; EU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-004-ukrpn---uk-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;UK Recruitment Privacy Notice / &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-005-eurpn---eu-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;EU Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, to evaluate your application and meet our legal and reporting obligations. In line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to request access to, rectification, or erasure (subject to legal limitations) of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the USA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data may be retained by Baringa for up to two years, as outlined in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to support the recruitment process and internal reporting requirements. Where applicable, and in accordance with relevant federal and state laws, you may have the right to request access to or correction of your personal information. For further details, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Australia &amp;amp; Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Ideally in Vienna, but anywhere in Spain, Poland or Germany also works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; English (mandatory); Swedish, Spanish, German, or French is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years in similar roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €60,000 – €70,000 gross annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time, permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Tax Compliance for Millions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they never notice it. We&#39;re the company behind compliance at the point of sale and e-invoicing — the invisible layer that keeps receipts tamper-proof, fights tax fraud, and helps merchants across Europe ditch paper for good.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s B2B, it&#39;s regulatory, and yes, it&#39;s complex. But our mission is simple: make tax compliance easy for everyone. If you want to build the infrastructure that quietly powers commerce for millions — you&#39;re in the right place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;European fiscalization and e-invoicing are fragmented, technical and deadline-driven. Every country has its own rules, its own timelines and its own competitive dynamics. Our buyers: POS manufacturers, PMS and ERP vendors, retailers, resellers&amp;nbsp; are not tax experts, and they do not want to become them. They want to know what a mandate means for them and what to do about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That translation is your job. You will own positioning and messaging for our products across markets, drive go-to-market for new launches and country expansions, and turn dense regulatory requirements into value propositions that land with a technical partner in Munich and a retail chain in Madrid alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role with a wide surface area. You will work closely with Product, Compliance, Demand Gen, Content, Sales and our country teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product positioning and messaging for fiskaly&#39;s fiscalization and e-invoicing products (SIGN, RECEIPT, E-INVOICE, SAFE) across multiple European markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and continuously sharpen our ICPs and buyer personas, POS manufacturers, retailers, resellers, PMS and ERP vendors, and equip Demand Gen with the segmentation, pain points and messaging they need to convert them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive go-to-market strategy for new product launches and country/regulation expansions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex regulatory and technical requirements into clear, accurate value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain sales enablement material, battlecards, one-pagers, demo scripts with Sales and Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own competitive intelligence and market research across the fragmented European compliance landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed market and customer signal into the product roadmap in partnership with Product Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep messaging consistent across DACH, Spain, Italy and our other country teams, with an ear for local nuance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply the Content team with ideas at scale and shape campaign concepts with Demand Generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track regulatory calendars (KassenSichV, RKSV, Verifactu, NF525, and what comes next)&amp;nbsp; these are effectively our market events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in B2B SaaS product marketing, ideally in regulated/compliance, fintech or infrastructure software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record positioning a technically complex or regulated product for buyers who are not experts in it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product launches and GTM plans you have owned end to end — not contributed to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of positioning and messaging frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing messaging across multiple countries and languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on sales enablement content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with competitive intelligence tools and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written English and the ability to make complexity feel simple without losing accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, shifting regulatory timelines and briefs that are not fully formed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultural sensitivity across DACH, Southern Europe and the Nordics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fiscalization, tax-tech, payments, or POS/retail tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Swedish, German, French, Spanish or Italian in addition to English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside legal or compliance functions on customer-facing messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅ What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that gives you space to grow, take ownership, and learn from trying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days per year if you&#39;re based in Austria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid work setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget for personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware of your choice (Windows, Linux, or Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that values clarity, well-being, and good work over noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ Why fiskaly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work on real problems that have impact, not vanity projects. Our team is pragmatic, direct, and focused on building solid tech for an industry that needs it. We care about how things work, not how they look on paper.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that resonates, you’ll probably enjoy working here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willst Du mit Deiner Arbeit echten Impact leisten und aktiv an einer sicheren digitalen Zukunft mitbauen? Dann bist Du bei uns richtig. Denn Cyber Security ist mehr als nur ein Trend – sie ist eine der zentralen Herausforderungen unserer Zeit. Genau hier kommst Du ins Spiel: Du entwickelst Kunden strategisch weiter, erkennst Chancen frühzeitig und baust nachhaltige Beziehungen auf. Gleichzeitig bieten wir Dir ein Umfeld, in dem Du wirklich etwas bewegen kannst: kurze Entscheidungswege, echtes Vertrauen und viel Gestaltungsspielraum. Deine Perspektive zählt – deshalb laden wir Dich aktiv ein, Deine Erfahrung einzubringen, ob regional, in bestimmten Branchen (Verticals) oder mit einem fachlichen Schwerpunkt. Wir glauben an Menschen, die mitdenken, Verantwortung übernehmen und Dinge vorantreiben wollen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei uns übernimmst Du Verantwortung, gestaltest aktiv mit und arbeitest in einem ambitionierten Team, das sich gegenseitig stärkt und gemeinsam wächst. Klingt nach Dir? Dann bewirb Dich jetzt und gestalte mit uns die Zukunft der Cyber Security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;„Cyber Security lebt von Vertrauen, starken Beziehungen und Menschen, die Verantwortung übernehmen. Genau deshalb suchen wir keinen klassischen Vertriebler, sondern jemanden, der Kunden strategisch entwickelt, Chancen erkennt und Themen nachhaltig vorantreibt. Bei uns bekommst du viel Eigenverantwortung, direkten Einfluss und ein Team, das ambitioniert arbeitet, sich gegenseitig unterstützt und Erfolge gemeinsam feiert.“&lt;/span&gt; Patrick Aigner, Head of Account Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du fühlst Dich angesprochen? Unser Team wächst stetig und wir suchen Dich als &lt;strong&gt;(Senior) Account Manager (m/w/d)&lt;/strong&gt; an einem unserer Standorte oder &lt;strong&gt;Remote&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WAS DU BEI UNS MACHST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Betreuung und strategische Entwicklung von Bestandskunden (Mittelstand bis Großkunden) in einem definierten Gebiet&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ausbau und Pflege langfristiger Kundenbeziehungen sowie Erweiterung des Netzwerks auf Fach- und Managementebene&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Planung und Koordination sämtlicher Vertriebsaktivitäten inklusive Präsentationen, Events und Messen&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Gewinnung neuer Kunden auf Basis qualifizierter Leads sowie Aufbau eines eigenen Zielkundenportfolios&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Erstellung von Angeboten und Verträgen sowie Mitwirkung an der Weiterentwicklung des Leistungsportfolios&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WIE DU UNS BEGEISTERST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abgeschlossenes Studium oder vergleichbare Ausbildung/Berufserfahrung im relevanten Bereich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mehrjährige Vertriebserfahrung sowie fundierte IT-Kenntnisse, idealerweise in der IT-Security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Kommunikations- und Verhandlungsfähigkeiten sowie sicheres Auftreten im Kundenkontakt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selbstständige, verantwortungsbewusste und belastbare Arbeitsweise mit hoher Flexibilität&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse, Reisebereitschaft sowie Führerschein der Klasse B&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(222, 220, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FEEL GOOD KULTUR @SITSGROUP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
